  dir_subsystem_err_dll.pcpp - break step of dir_subsystem.pcpp: gui on a
  module that is not an exe (a warning: the setting is not used, the build
  goes on)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\dir_subsystem_err_dll.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\dir_subsystem_err_dll.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
*******************************************************************************/

module dll dir_subsystem_err_dll;
@subsystem gui; // WARN SM0103@1: a module that is not an exe

end.
